      <slug></slug>
      <title>The Ruby and .NET love child</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will be about leveraging IronRuby from Mono and moonlight. Depending on the time I&amp;#39;d like to show how you can use IronRuby to easily extend your current GTK, WinForms,.. apps with scripting capabilities.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Perhaps how you can use IronRuby from Asp.NET MVC. If there is still time left I&amp;#39;d like to show you can script the browser and use Moonlight + IronRuby to use ruby as client scriping language instead or in cooperation with JavaScript.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1891">Ivan Porto Carrero</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>